      Data: 15|UnityEngine.TooltipAttribute, UnityEngine.CoreModule
    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: 1/m. Upward acceleration = lift * horizontalSpeed^2 (capped), so a fast
        disc floats and sinks as it slows. With 0.3 anything above ~5.6 m/s starts
        at full lift; the first Play (drag 0.30 / lift 0.12) dropped an 8 m/s throw
        in 1.2 s
